  "description": "HC-130 King and HH-60 Pave Hawk fly pass the base during dignified arrival for Maj. Christopher T. Zanetis, HH-60 rescue pilot, Master Sgt. Christopher J. Raguso, HH-60 rescue pilot and Tech. Sgt. Dashan J. Briggs, special missions aviation specialist, assigned to the 106th Rescue Wing, at F. S. Gabreski Air National Guard Base, Westhampton Beach, N.Y., March 27, 2018. The three Airmen were killed when the HH-60G Pave Hawk helicopter they were flying in crashed near the city of Al-Qa’im, Iraq. (U.S. Video by Airman Sean Madden)",
